Lock是接口，不能直接实例化， 通常采用它的子类`ReentrantLock`来实例化

```java
new Thread(new Runnable() {
    private static final Lock lock = new ReentrantLock(); // 1. 保证lock唯一
    @Override
    public void run() {
        while (true) {
            lock.lock();
            try{
                System.out.println(Thread.currentThread().getName());
            }catch (Exception e){
                throw new RuntimeException(e);
            }finally {
                lock.unlock();  // 2.保证最终都会被执行
            }


        }
    }
}).start();
```

